meta {
  name: Create article
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/gallery
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "title": "Escena urbana de Guatemala",
    "slug": "{{articleSlug}}",
    "subtitle": "Artistas y espacios de la ciudad",
    "category": "EDITORIAL",
    "heroImageUrl": "https://example.com/portada.webp",
    "videoUrl": null,
    "videoSource": "NONE",
    "contentMarkdown": "## La escena\nTexto del artículo.",
    "readingTimeMinutes": 5,
    "subjectName": "Colectivo UV",
    "location": "Ciudad de Guatemala",
    "externalUrl": "https://example.com/artista",
    "eventDate": "2026-12-01T18:00:00Z",
    "isFeatured": false,
    "isPublished": true,
    "shopCollectionSlug": "urban-art",
    "shopCollectionTitle": "Urban Art",
    "tags": [
      "graffiti",
      "guatemala"
    ],
    "galleryImageUrls": [
      "https://example.com/detalle.webp"
    ]
  }
}

script:post-response {
  if (res.status >= 200 && res.status < 300 && res.body?.id) {
    bru.setVar("articleId", res.body.id);
  }
  if (res.status >= 200 && res.status < 300 && res.body?.slug) {
    bru.setVar("articleSlug", res.body.slug);
  }
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 201
}

docs {
  # Create article

  `POST /api/gallery`

  Create an article with a unique slug.

  ## Authentication

  Admin or Editor; inherited Bearer token.

  ## Parameters

  No path or query parameters.

  ## Request body

  | Field | Type | Rules / default |
  | --- | --- | --- |
  | title | string | POST requires a nonblank title; PUT has no equivalent explicit check. |
  | slug | string | Generated from title if blank; otherwise lowercased. Must be unique. |
  | subtitle, heroImageUrl, contentMarkdown | string | Empty string if omitted. URLs are not format-validated. |
  | category | string | EDITORIAL if blank or omitted; stored uppercase. |
  | videoUrl | string or null | Optional. |
  | videoSource | string | NONE if blank or omitted; uppercase, no validated enum. |
  | readingTimeMinutes | integer | 5 if omitted or <= 0. |
  | subjectName, location, externalUrl | string or null | Optional. |
  | eventDate | ISO 8601 date or null | Optional. |
  | isFeatured | boolean | false; featuring removes featured status from other articles. |
  | isPublished | boolean | true. |
  | shopCollectionSlug, shopCollectionTitle | string or null | Optional shop references, not validated against the shop. |
  | tags | string[] | []; values are lowercased. |
  | galleryImageUrls | string[] | []; file existence is not checked. |

  Send Content-Type: application/json.

  ```json
  {
    "title": "Escena urbana de Guatemala",
    "slug": "{{articleSlug}}",
    "subtitle": "Artistas y espacios de la ciudad",
    "category": "EDITORIAL",
    "heroImageUrl": "https://example.com/portada.webp",
    "videoUrl": null,
    "videoSource": "NONE",
    "contentMarkdown": "## La escena\nTexto del artículo.",
    "readingTimeMinutes": 5,
    "subjectName": "Colectivo UV",
    "location": "Ciudad de Guatemala",
    "externalUrl": "https://example.com/artista",
    "eventDate": "2026-12-01T18:00:00Z",
    "isFeatured": false,
    "isPublished": true,
    "shopCollectionSlug": "urban-art",
    "shopCollectionTitle": "Urban Art",
    "tags": [
      "graffiti",
      "guatemala"
    ],
    "galleryImageUrls": [
      "https://example.com/detalle.webp"
    ]
  }
  ```

  ## Response

  HTTP **201**.

  ```json
  {
    "title": "Escena urbana de Guatemala",
    "slug": "urban-scene",
    "subtitle": "Artistas y espacios de la ciudad",
    "category": "EDITORIAL",
    "heroImageUrl": "https://example.com/portada.webp",
    "videoUrl": null,
    "videoSource": "NONE",
    "contentMarkdown": "## La escena\nTexto del artículo.",
    "readingTimeMinutes": 5,
    "subjectName": "Colectivo UV",
    "location": "Ciudad de Guatemala",
    "externalUrl": "https://example.com/artista",
    "eventDate": "2026-12-01T18:00:00Z",
    "isFeatured": false,
    "isPublished": true,
    "shopCollectionSlug": "urban-art",
    "shopCollectionTitle": "Urban Art",
    "tags": [
      "graffiti",
      "guatemala"
    ],
    "galleryImageUrls": [
      "https://example.com/detalle.webp"
    ],
    "id": "44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444444",
    "publishedAt": "2026-11-14T12:00:00Z",
    "createdAt": "2026-11-14T12:00:00Z",
    "updatedAt": null
  }
  ```

  ## Errors

  - 400: Title is required. / An article with this slug already exists. / model validation.
  - 401: missing, invalid, or expired Bearer token.
  - 403: authenticated token with an insufficient role.

  Automatic model validation can return ValidationProblemDetails; explicit controller errors use a message field. Authentication middleware errors may have no body.

  ## Notes

  Captures articleId and articleSlug; returns a Location header. Sets publishedAt and createdAt to current UTC even when unpublished. Featuring an article unfeatures others. Automatic slug generation lowercases, replaces spaces with hyphens, and removes : ? ! /; it does not remove accents.

  Examples contain fictitious data. The assertion checks the successful scenario; a missing record or insufficient permissions can produce a different documented status.
}
